  ('7579ae60-f782-4079-8dca-1fefc1412925', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:6a70ebde98f72327f7992fea', 'https://www.goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1970s-patek-philippe-ref-3633-w-onyx-stone-dial-18k-yg', '{"text":"A spectacular 1970s Patek Philippe ref. 3633 in a sharp 34mm x 29mm 18K yellow gold case featuring the prominent ribbed texture made famous on this reference, with a flawless deep and dark black Onyx stone dial, free of any cracks or chips, its case retaining clear and crisp hallmarks also achieving a reddish patina over the decades, indicative of a life free from abuse of polish or overwear. \nIt’s manually wound Patek cal. 177 is running well and keeping accurate time. We do not have service history. Extract from the archives has been ordered.","title":"1970''s Patek Philippe ref. 3633 w/ Onyx Stone Dial 18K YG","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/e827d5b6-7bfd-45c5-84fb-b31c97dc3a43/B0004946.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/472a5e67-b420-405c-acaf-597f19d3a775/B0004984.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/cb523e27-c385-499f-94e6-7ce497d427d4/B0004973.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/f643f316-5951-4356-9206-7887460797fc/B0004971.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/73d00c56-2386-4412-8a77-37bcba6f9956/B0004968.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/f184c8e9-6839-41f1-a040-63cc10015728/B0004966.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/c7c56ab8-4ae0-4bba-bd3a-de371513b01a/B0004960.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/89b44ba3-447c-47e9-b6f3-0b820bdd916a/B0004952.jpg?format