  ('bb887cbf-b51e-4c26-b35d-9c008300a912', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:6a66e8caee0be167547500c5', 'https://www.goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1930s-patek-philippe-sector-dial-tank-carr-pre-reference', '{"text":"An incredible 1930s Patek Philippe pre-reference Tank Carr&eacute; with a gorgeous sector dial in phenomenal condition, its hand carved enamel dial with stunning relief and clarity present after nearly a century of life, its 26x26mm case sharp and patinated, with convex sloped top and bottom bezels defining its edges at crimped corners, powered by an early LeCoultre based, Patek signed caliber that is keeping accurate time. \nWe have just filed for its Patek Philippe Extract from the Archives.","title":"1930''s Patek Philippe Sector Dial Tank Carré Pre-Reference","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/4749b1b0-a245-45df-9f47-482bd59e5540/B0004457.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/505492f0-c47d-4b69-a735-330a1c004b9f/B0004471.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/7e14aca3-0e1e-4fac-9e28-a560cdc6febf/B0004495.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/c9167a0a-fdec-4606-a9e4-d62124b963ad/B0004524.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/406ae9d9-3881-498c-96f0-13c00e9912af/B0004508.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/82ae94c0-c899-4a82-95e2-a571e8de12e4/B0004505.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/bf901352-a897-494d-ac1c-364467e00ce5/B0004503.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/990fbe5a-dc3d-4903-9025-99cc82bf118c/B0004501.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/conten