:"Omega","has_box":null,"winding":"manual","currency":"USD","brand_key":"boucheron","condition":"top condition","reference":null,"dial_color":"other","has_papers":null,"description":"This rare 1950s Boucheron Carré features a 24mm solid 18K yellow gold case and a blue enamel bezel with a checkered motif, powered by a manually wound Omega caliber.","price_cents":1889500,"case_size_mm":24,"case_material":"yellow_gold","complications":[]}'::jsonb, 'de674d30c4504aa206adb8481bea1ded560e601d1932a3a6bf68928a0718717b', null, null, null, null, '2026-09-14T15:48:11.878242+00:00', '2026-09-16T06:26:49.887+00:00'),
